Type: Package
Package: rminka
Title: Direct Access to Minka Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ramon", "Servitje", email = "rservitje25@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-8701-8953"))
Description: Provides tools to query, retrieve and process data from the
    Minka digital platform, a citizen-science biodiversity portal,
    via its public API <https://minka-sdg.org>. Functions handle
    authentication, download observations, and convert responses into
    tidy data frames and simple features objects for spatial analysis.
    The package streamlines reproducible workflows without requiring
    manual data exports.
License: GPL-3
